provider: opsgenie (Opsgenie)

## minimal config
{
  "api_key": "secret-api_key",
  "priority": "P1",
  "region": "us"
}

### down
POST https://api.opsgenie.com/v2/alerts
Authorization: GenieKey secret-api_key
(json)
{
  "alias": "vv-monitor-7",
  "description": "HTTP 503 (after 3 retries)\nTarget: https://pay.example/health\nType: HTTP(S)\nTime: 2026-10-19 14:03:12 UTC\nhttps://vv.example/monitors/7",
  "details": {
    "event": "down",
    "target": "https://pay.example/health",
    "url": "https://vv.example/monitors/7"
  },
  "entity": "Payments API",
  "message": "Payments API is down",
  "priority": "P1",
  "source": "Vigilant Vole",
  "tags": [
    "vigilant-vole"
  ]
}

### up
POST https://api.opsgenie.com/v2/alerts/vv-monitor-7/close?identifierType=alias
Authorization: GenieKey secret-api_key
(json)
{
  "note": "🟢 Payments API is back up — down for 12m 4s",
  "source": "Vigilant Vole"
}

